    "Only plans in 'verified' can become 'measured', and only by system:analytics.",
    "A measurement is written in the same transaction as the transition.",
    "Synthetic data never measures: a synthetic import performs no sweep at all.",
    "A rolled-back plan's live window is closed by its transition, whatever the deployment shape.",
    "A CMS no-op (stage already_applied only) is attributed and measurable like any other deployed plan.",
